Rule 6 (input tensor has valid shape for comparison with other tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1
